OL,3,AEthiopia and Eritrea cut diplomatic
OL,4,Aties as northern conflict escalates
OL,5,
OL,6,FEthiopia and Eritrea have severed
OL,7,Fdiplomatic relations as renewed
OL,8,Ffighting in northern Ethiopia raises
OL,9,Ffears of a wider regional conflict.
OL,11,FOn Thursday, Ethiopia announced that it
OL,12,Fwas closing its embassy in the Eritrean
OL,13,Fcapital, Asmara, and ordered 10
OL,14,FEritrean diplomats to leave the country
OL,15,Fwithin 48 hours, accusing them of
OL,16,Factivities that threatened national
OL,17,Fsecurity.
OL,19,FEritrea responded by cutting diplomatic
OL,20,Frelations, saying Ethiopia's decision
OL,21,Fhad left it with no choice but to take
OL,22,Freciprocal action.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
