OL,3,AEthiopia and Eritrea cut diplomatic
OL,4,Aties as northern conflict escalates
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe diplomatic confrontation came hours
OL,7,Fafter powerful explosions were heard
OL,8,Fovernight in Ethiopian capital, Addis
OL,9,FAbaba, including near Ethiopia's
OL,10,Fmilitary headquarters.
